{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13d5_level_act13d5_03_end",
  "groupId": "act13d5",
  "stageId": "act13d5_03",
  "title": "玫瑰報業",
  "storyCode": "MN-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "297d3e69c757e484ef24a75b36f4f8a208cb3d867e032b16fb5dd56e87fa47f5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 3下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪莉婭。\n瑪莉婭，你有一雙天馬的眼睛。\n瑪莉婭，站起來，來，過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈......哈......！居然躲開了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那好吧，就讓你的右手在你的身上多待一會......反正就一小會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（——不是眼淚，黏糊糊的，是血？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（......好多血......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（心跳好快......我......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "滑稽，真滑稽，你揮舞武器的樣子就像大騎士團門前的那些弄臣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "除了外貌，你有哪點像那個耀騎士了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我是不會輸的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啊，這樣我更樂意撕碎你那張臉了，不識好歹的貴族妞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "英格拉！風暴般的追擊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是本次賽事以來，呼嘯競技場最誇張的一次損毀——！賽場屠夫英格拉！“鏽銅”英格拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就在一個月前，“鏽銅”英格拉在本賽季的首秀就將“焚風”騎士毆打致四肢粉碎性骨折才肯甘休！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒錯，是毆打！這絕非手持武器的騎士行徑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天，在呼嘯競技場備受矚目的瑪莉婭·臨光，是否也難逃“鏽銅”殘暴的利斧？觀眾們，告訴我你們的態度！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是這樣！“鏽銅”英格拉！讓你的對手血濺當場吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼啊......哈啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（好重——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭！投降吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是輸掉一場比賽而已！積分還是有機會的——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "佐菲婭姑母......在說什麼？\n聽不清......頭好暈......盾也好重......\n我......在做什麼......騎士競技......我在賽場上......\n快......睜開眼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼啊......呼啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈！不錯的反擊——這才有撕裂你的意義！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼快就完蛋可沒意思了，我要用你的血，塗滿你那張讓人火大的臉......耀騎士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你明明......也快到極限了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，這點血也能叫傷！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_122",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......英格拉提前出戰了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_123",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "國民院提前釋放了他，嘁，這審判根本就形同虛設。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_123",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來集團為他掏了不少錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_122",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯哼......玫瑰報業聯合集團有的是錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_122",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還真讓人火大，人渣和輿論反倒能帶來利潤，那個解說員甚至敢在公開賽事拿這種事來說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_123",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為他們不怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_122",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是呀，怕啥呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_123",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怕我們，英格拉不喜歡失敗，而我會讓他一敗塗地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_122",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別呀，說好的讓我上呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_122",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過在那之前......如果小臨光還不想想辦法，她會傷得很重的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——血肉橫飛的場景遲遲沒有到來！瑪莉婭·臨光，比想像中還要頑強的少女！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還在等什麼，難道這樣的騎士不讓人心生敬仰嗎！？別忘了！本賽季的敬仰手續費只需要百分之五十！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——等等！情況又有變化！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對峙著的二人——瑪莉婭竟然捨棄了盾牌！發生了什麼！？難道她想靠那把脆弱的單手劍接下英格拉的巨斧！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "巨大的體格差，巨大的力量差，只是靠著靈活的身手勉強躲避的瑪莉婭，終於準備正面對決了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "容我再強調一遍——！本賽季的手續費只有一半！這樣勇敢的行徑難道不值幾十枚金幣嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈啊......哈啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......做的，還不賴，你這小妞......淡淡的光覆蓋在劍刃上，這是你最後的手段嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_104",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，好啊！我會撕下你的手臂，然後用你的血肉塞住你的喉嚨——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "必須獲勝......必須......\n我在做什麼來著......騎士競技，需要殺死對手嗎？\n盾，不需要......我擋不住他的重斧......\n但他也受傷了，他不在乎......他像個怪物，他殺伐取樂......\n我......該怎麼面對這樣的敵人......敵人？他不是騎士嗎？\n騎士......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“所謂騎士，就是照亮整片大地的崇高者。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "疼、疼疼疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......醒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姑母......？我怎麼......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想起來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我輸了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是英格拉也倒下了，你們兩個人的積分都沒有變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是、是這樣，呼......那就好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "根本就不好！你受了傷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "面對那樣的對手，你應該棄權的，瑪莉婭，只是放棄一場比賽，積分還可以再想辦法追回來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果只是想要贏得封號保住貴族之名，何必要這麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我沒想過要棄權。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然萬幸沒有傷筋動骨......對手是英格拉還能全身而退，真的算你運氣好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你再受傷，就算能夠進入特錦賽又怎麼樣！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......他很厲害，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很不像騎士。他的家族本來就家大業大，參賽也只是來享受施暴樂趣的，奧爾默·英格拉就是這樣的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭，你如果再受這樣的傷，我不允許你繼續參賽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽姐姐的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我知道了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別亂動，好好休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然是平手，但是接下來找到你的企業合作會越來越多......我和馬丁叔會暫時幫你謝絕一些，你必須安心養傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......那把劍是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是我以前的佩劍。上次訓練的時候把它翻出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼佐菲婭姐姐要特地帶著這把劍......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（姑母明明已經......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒什麼特別的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是萬一英格拉真的對你做了些什麼，哪怕事後要面對國民院，我也會親手殺了他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不、不用考慮到這一步啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......能給我看看嗎？好像已經很久沒用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行，好好休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "光待在床上會生鏽的啦……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佐菲婭姐姐，姑母，就這一個要求，我會乖乖待在家裡休息的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......唉，越來越像你姐姐了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給你吧，別對它做什麼奇怪的事情，我還是挺愛惜的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸......這不是挺多灰的嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "灰塵才是愛惜的證明！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們大包小包的是要去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去探望一下瑪莉婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "英格拉那個混蛋，對丫頭下那麼重的手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我倒覺得你們別去打擾她們比較好，佐菲婭會照顧好瑪莉婭的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我坐不住啊！你看到英格拉最後那一斧了嗎？萬一留下什麼後遺症怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一個老騎士和一個老工匠，總是能幫上忙的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那遇上瑪恩納怎麼辦？就不怕他一手一個把你們拎出去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那臭小子，臨光老爺在的時候哪敢這麼放肆，打不過還躲不起嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唔，那兩個老頭剛走就有新客人了，看來他們是我的煞星啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "酒吧可好久沒來過這麼可愛的客人了啊，需要點什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "speakerToken": "char_204_platnm_1",
      "operatorId": "char_204_platnm",
      "portraitKey": "char_204_platnm",
      "text": "......這名字挺好聽的，就這個吧，“荊棘淚珠”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
